use of information in or reliance upon this document.&quot;#xD;#xA;#xD;#xA;GS1 and the GS1 logo are registered trademarks of GS1 AISBL.\">Global Location Number (GLN)</a>/7350088100003</p><p><b>active</b>: true</p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Koder:{https://hsa.inera.se/fhir/CodeSystem/hsa-object-class healthcare-provider}\">Vårdgivare</span>, <span title=\"Koder:{urn:oid:1.2.752.129.2.2.1.14 01}\">Landsting/region</span></p><p><b>name</b>: Region Blekinge</p><h3>Contacts</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Telecom</b></td><td><b>Address</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>ph: 0455-73 10 00(Work), ph: 0455-73 10 00(Work), <a href=\"mailto:region@regionblekinge.se\">region@regionblekinge.se</a>, <a href=\"mailto:redaktion@regionblekinge.se\">redaktion@regionblekinge.se</a>, <a href=\"https://www.regionblekinge.se\">https://www.regionblekinge.se</a></td><td> </td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td> </td><td>Box 515</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
